'''Ruthless Tyrant (Merciless)''' is the only stage in '''The Malevolent Cow''', which is unlocked after clearing [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku/Mount Fuji]] in [[The Aku Realms]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] and appears on the '''15th''' of every month. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

