==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], Ruthless Tyrant was an Insane stage. This was most likely a translation error.
*Ruthless Tyrant's Japanese name, Raion King (来怨キング), is a pun: 来怨 literally translates to "coming resentment", but also happens to be pronounced ''raion'', the Japanese pronunciation of ''[[Malevolent Lion Cat|lion]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], the enemy base had 1,500,000 HP instead of 2,500,000.

